{"version":1,"title":"SamuFlore - 第 6 页","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"navbar top\"><div class=\"navbar-blur\"><div class=\"navbar-container\"><nav class=\"post\"><a class=\"active\" href=\"/\">近期发布</a><a href=\"/categories/\">分类</a><a href=\"/tags/\">标签</a><a href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><a href=\"/archives/\">归档</a><a href=\"/recent/\">BAKER</a></nav></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"post-list post\"><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/52a88c87/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO]CO 理论概要</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北航计算机组成理论概要。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-16T12:50:27.000Z\">2025-12-16</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/1a21b5b/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[楠竹蓮花集]十二月八日</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>二〇二五年十二月八日是个重大的日子。这一天结束了我的计组实验，同时让我第一次意识到我已经是个成年人了。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-09T04:29:46.000Z\">2025-12-09</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\" style=\"--text-p2:#FFDD88;--theme-block:#FFDD8820\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>楠竹蓮花集</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/444343b2/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO Finale] 2025 北航计算机组成实验总结</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>买了点烤串，买了一杯 RIO 回寝室放松一下。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-08T15:26:29.000Z\">2025-12-08</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/28be479a/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P7]Verilog 设计 MIPS 微系统</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>It's time to leave all behind.</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-08T14:48:21.000Z\">2025-12-08</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/905092e9/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P6]Verilog 设计五级流水线 CPU-2</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>我去，这才是我最接近 AK 的一次呃呃……</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-01T13:15:56.000Z\">2025-12-01</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/65cd5a9/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P5]Verilog 设计五级流水线 CPU</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>仍旧猛攻 1h 第三题未通过。不过所幸 P5 这道鬼门关一次过了，题也都抄下来了。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-11-24T13:17:38.000Z\">2025-11-24</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/cb2f1325/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[Repost]How To Ask Questions The Smart Way</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>本指南英文版版权为 Eric S. Raymond, Rick Moen 所有。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-11-19T14:39:40.000Z\">2025-11-19</time></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/53039668/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P4]Verilog 设计单周期 CPU</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>唉唉，又差一点把第三题做出来。猛攻 1h 以失败告终……不过起码通过了，开心~</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-11-17T13:19:44.000Z\">2025-11-17</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/be27c6b/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[孤獨星球]林信之江传</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>林信之江是网名，故不需要缀以“君”的称呼。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-11-09T15:27:08.000Z\">2025-11-09</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\" style=\"--text-p2:#7799CC;--theme-block:#7799CC20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>孤獨星球</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/deef238d/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA OO Pre]2025 面向对象程序设计先导课程总结</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>OO Pre!</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-11-05T03:42:43.000Z\">2025-11-05</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 面向對象設計與構造</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div></div>\n\n  <div class=\"paginator-wrap dis-select\">\n  <a class=\"extend prev\" rel=\"prev\" href=\"/page/5/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:arrow-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></a><a class=\"page-number\" href=\"/\">1</a><span class=\"space\">…</span><a class=\"page-number\" href=\"/page/4/\">4</a><a class=\"page-number\" href=\"/page/5/\">5</a><span class=\"page-number current\">6</span><a class=\"page-number\" href=\"/page/7/\">7</a><a class=\"page-number\" href=\"/page/8/\">8</a><a class=\"page-number\" href=\"/page/9/\">9</a><a class=\"extend next\" rel=\"next\" href=\"/page/7/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></a>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"index","layout":"undefined","type":"undefined","textIndent":false}